WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.600
[James] …and particularly spent
a lot of time in

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:10.080
investments and pensions
and other savings vehicles.

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:13.360
So that's really where we got to today
and why we're here.

00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:15.360
[Scott] Right. Okay.

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:19.660
And so tell us about what is Waive
and how you came to realise

00:00:19.660 --> 00:00:21.560
there was a problem
that you felt you could fix?

00:00:21.560 --> 00:00:25.450
[James] Yeah. The problem we're trying
to fix is something called the advice gap,

00:00:25.450 --> 00:00:27.900
which affects millions
of people in the UK.

00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:32.710
We recognise the gap, it's well
documented. It's basically the gap where

00:00:32.710 --> 00:00:35.800
people need financial advice
but can't afford it.

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:39.660
Only very few people can afford
to have it, but everybody needs it,

00:00:39.660 --> 00:00:42.560
especially with things like
auto-enrolment, which is encouraging

00:00:42.560 --> 00:00:44.840
everybody to start saving
into pensions.

00:00:44.840 --> 00:00:48.340
But ultimately, everybody needs
personalised advice,

00:00:48.340 --> 00:00:51.040
and today they don't get it.

00:00:51.040 --> 00:00:54.410
So Waive is a product
that's built to

00:00:54.410 --> 00:00:59.640
automate financial advice for everybody,

00:00:59.640 --> 00:01:02.080
to make sure that financial advice
is inclusive,

00:01:02.080 --> 00:01:06.360
accessible and affordable –
most importantly, for everybody.

00:01:06.360 --> 00:01:08.770
[Scott] So you mentioned
the advice gap,

00:01:08.770 --> 00:01:11.760
and you talk about who it's for,
but help us understand

00:01:11.760 --> 00:01:13.800
how big is that problem?

00:01:13.800 --> 00:01:15.800
[James] The problem is huge.

00:01:15.800 --> 00:01:18.410
Only 8% of people in the UK
get financial advice,

00:01:18.410 --> 00:01:23.380
and everybody at some point in their life,
and at multiple points during their life,

00:01:23.380 --> 00:01:24.800
need financial advice.

00:01:24.800 --> 00:01:29.780
Unfortunately, everybody is very
disengaged with things like their pension

00:01:29.780 --> 00:01:33.000
because they don't understand it,
they don't get clear advice.
